{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gmhmtjhpHl1795075774.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB今日（19日）迎來59周年台慶大日子，大型特備節目《萬千星輝賀台慶》將於今晚7時許在電視廣播城隆重舉行，並由翡翠台全程現場直播。今年台慶陣容鼎盛，除了集結全台逾200位藝員及歌手施展渾身解數帶來連場精彩表演外，更重磅邀得三屆視帝羅嘉良及許志安擔任特別嘉賓，勢必將全晚氣氛推向高峰。</p><p></p><p>大會司儀陣容同樣星光熠熠，由汪明荃領軍，聯同林溥來、朱凱婷、周奕瑋、洪永城、黃翠如、陸浩明、麥美恩、鄭衍峰、林秀怡、孔德賢及潘靜文合共12位主持坐鎮全場。除了連串歌舞及特備演出外，每年備受矚目的台慶大抽獎亦已準備就緒，獎金獎品相當豐富，與全港觀眾一齊熱鬧歡度TVB 59歲生日派對。</p><p></p><p><strong>PART 1 OPENING</strong></p><p>張振朗、劉穎鏇、周嘉洛、吳偉豪、朱敏瀚、陳曉華、馬貫東、劉佩玥、羅天宇、黃庭鋒等率領逾80藝員齊集6號幹線 (中九龍繞道—九龍灣段)揭開台慶序幕。 三屆視帝羅嘉良（撈家）孖關嘉敏、游嘉欣、李海銅、鍾柔美、劉芷君、羅天宇及劉倬昕等新生代藝人再現《難兄難弟》精彩場面，齊齊唱《奇哥》！</p><p><p><img alt=\"f4eeefe5-4854-4a2e-9332-c038a3785cd2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gmIqD15wPb1795089876.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"227dd646-e871-42a5-8c4d-bdf6b70e0aa0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WDl0tVWQX01795089891.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"3cbd4c11-89ec-4486-82b6-1110484c3ee0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KWk4xJlacQ1795089907.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6068.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265FWLOFD7Ct1795090860.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6177.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EknaOHYOIk1795090927.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"batch_FR6D6047.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026u1BGZJoSkb1795090953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><strong>PART 2 東張女神盃</strong></p><p>6位東張女神包括李旻芳、梁敏巧、黎寬怡、甘詠寧、何沛珈、陳庭欣手持咪進行400米跑步比賽，最終李旻芳奪得第一名，何沛珈包尾！</p><p><p><img alt=\"52cf7ef7-fca3-410d-982e-3e04129798f8.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ElsYQqQwqk1795092246.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"8c4f149e-8776-49cb-93b7-6c1fe1fe9a02.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hlfYVGgEOl1795092261.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"5370b88d-24e8-42a9-9a1d-15d84857b7ab.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oaz82A9gWN1795091948.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"be61462e-a9b0-4680-b493-2486dd61fba5.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264DT6kQ3oin1795091963.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.820024+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":517,"images":11,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:08:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:10:58.344327+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:54.757635+00:00","content_hash":"5beb820404771bf59d465a77c2dfdc12aad0dfc29a5039f1810f171efecffa8c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.820024+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}